{"id":"2609d606ab82080f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/604_缺省道义逻辑.md","title":"604 缺省道义逻辑","display":"604_缺省道义逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{obl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{obl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad OA=\\operatorname{obl}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad OA=\\operatorname{obl}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\qquad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\qquad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\qquad A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>缺省规则基的载体与参数在公式闭包之后定义，避免前向引用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{obl}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{obl}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"OA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(OA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义缺省规则载体与参数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Default}_{604}=\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}^{3},\\qquad\n\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Default}_{604}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Default}_{604}=\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}^{3},\\qquad\n\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Default}_{604}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,J,C)\\in\\Delta\">\\((P,J,C)\\in\\Delta\\)</span> 表示前提、理由与结论三个句法分量。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{604}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{604}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(OA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(OA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{604}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{604}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{604}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(OA)=O\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(OA)=O\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{604}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{604}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{604}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{604}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{604}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{604}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{604}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{604}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,604}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{604}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{604}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,604}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-基础道义演算\">4. 基础道义演算</h1>\n<p>命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{604}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{604}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{604}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{604}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{604}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{604}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>道义正规性与一致性公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_O}^{604}\n=\n\\{O(A\\to B)\\to(OA\\to OB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_O}^{604}\n=\n\\{O(A\\to B)\\to(OA\\to OB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D_O}^{604}\n=\n\\{OA\\to\\neg O\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D_O}^{604}\n=\n\\{OA\\to\\neg O\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{0}^{604}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{604}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{604}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{604}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_O}^{604}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{D_O}^{604}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{0}^{604}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{604}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{604}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{604}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_O}^{604}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{D_O}^{604}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基础规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{604}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{604}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{604}=\\{((A),OA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{604}=\\{((A),OA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{0}^{604}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{604}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{604}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{0}^{604}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{604}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecO}^{604}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示分式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{0,604}A}{\\vdash_{0,604}OA}\\;(NecO).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{0,604}A}{\\vdash_{0,604}OA}\\;(NecO).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span> 出发的基础证明对象集合\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{0}^{604}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{0}^{604}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 由所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\">\\(\\Delta_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的有限子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>。每行至少满足下列 4 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{0}^{604}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{0}^{604}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=OA_j\">\\(A_i=OA_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((D_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{0}^{604}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((D_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{0}^{604}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{0,604}(\\pi)=(D_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{0,604}(\\pi)=(D_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{0,604}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{0,604}A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{0}^{604}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{0}^{604}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(D\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{0,604}(\\pi)=(D,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{0,604}(\\pi)=(D,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{0,604}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{0,604}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{0,604}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{0,604}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-缺省侧条件\">5. 缺省侧条件</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(J\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>，定义基础一致性谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cons}_{604}(\\Gamma,J)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\Gamma\\not\\vdash_{0,604}\\neg J.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cons}_{604}(\\Gamma,J)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\Gamma\\not\\vdash_{0,604}\\neg J.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>，缺省规则关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Def}^{\\Delta,\\Gamma}\n=\n\\{((P),C):(P,J,C)\\in\\Delta,\\ \\operatorname{Cons}_{604}(\\Gamma,J)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Def}^{\\Delta,\\Gamma}\n=\n\\{((P),C):(P,J,C)\\in\\Delta,\\ \\operatorname{Cons}_{604}(\\Gamma,J)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其显示分式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{P\\qquad (P,J,C)\\in\\Delta\\qquad \\operatorname{Cons}_{604}(\\Gamma,J)}{C}\\;(Def).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{P\\qquad (P,J,C)\\in\\Delta\\qquad \\operatorname{Cons}_{604}(\\Gamma,J)}{C}\\;(Def).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该关系的前提型为一元公式元组，结论型为公式。</p>\n<p>缺省规则族定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak R_{Def}^{604,\\Delta}\n=\n\\{\\mathsf{Rule}_{Def}^{\\Delta,\\Gamma}:\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak R_{Def}^{604,\\Delta}\n=\n\\{\\mathsf{Rule}_{Def}^{\\Delta,\\Gamma}:\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-缺省证明对象\">6. 缺省证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\)</span>\n由所有满足下列条件的非空有限序列组成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\">\\(\\Delta_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的有限子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}\\)</span>。每行满足以下之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{0}^{604}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{0}^{604}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=OA_j\">\\(A_i=OA_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,J,A_i)\\in\\Delta\">\\((P,J,A_i)\\in\\Delta\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=P\">\\(A_j=P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cons}_{604}(\\Gamma,J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cons}_{604}(\\Gamma,J)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-缺省可证性\">7. 缺省可证性</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((D_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\">\\(\\pi=((D_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{Def,604}(\\pi)=(D_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{Def,604}(\\pi)=(D_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{604}^{\\Delta}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{604}^{\\Delta}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(D\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，使\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{Def,604}(\\pi)=(D,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{Def,604}(\\pi)=(D,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>可核验缺省证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)=\n\\{(A,\\pi):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta),\\ \n\\exists D\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{Def,604}(\\pi)=(D,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)=\n\\{(A,\\pi):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\ \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604}(\\Gamma,\\Delta),\\ \n\\exists D\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{Def,604}(\\pi)=(D,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>缺省闭包定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{604}^{\\Delta}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{604}^{\\Delta}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cn}_{604}^{\\Delta}(\\Gamma)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{604}^{\\Delta}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-扩张语义\">8. 扩张语义</h1>\n<p>定义基础道义模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DMod}_{604}\">\\(\\mathsf{DMod}_{604}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,R,V),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,R,V),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Serial}_{604}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\forall w\\in W\\ \\exists v\\in W\\ (wRv).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Serial}_{604}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\forall w\\in W\\ \\exists v\\in W\\ (wRv).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Serial}_{604}(W,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Serial}_{604}(W,R)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>。满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}A\">\\(\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}A\\)</span> 递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in V(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}\\operatorname{atom}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in V(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{604}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{604}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{604}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{604}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{604}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{604}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}OA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,v\\Vdash_{604}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}OA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,v\\Vdash_{604}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>基础道义语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{0,604}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{DMod}_{604}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\ \n\\bigl((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{0,604}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{DMod}_{604}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\ \n\\bigl((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{604}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>先定义基础闭包与相对于候选集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的可应用结论：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{0,604}(X)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:X\\vdash_{0,604}A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cn}_{0,604}(X)=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:X\\vdash_{0,604}A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{604}^{\\Delta}(E)\n=\\{C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:\\exists P,J\\ ((P,J,C)\\in\\Delta\\land P\\in E\\land\\neg J\\notin E)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{App}_{604}^{\\Delta}(E)\n=\\{C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:\\exists P,J\\ ((P,J,C)\\in\\Delta\\land P\\in E\\land\\neg J\\notin E)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>缺省生成算子及其不动点类定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_{604}^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{604})\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}),\\qquad\n\\mathcal G_{604}^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}(E)=\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{0,604}\\bigl(\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{App}_{604}^{\\Delta}(E)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal G_{604}^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{604})\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}),\\qquad\n\\mathcal G_{604}^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}(E)=\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{0,604}\\bigl(\\Gamma\\cup\\operatorname{App}_{604}^{\\Delta}(E)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ext}_{604}^{\\Delta}(\\Gamma)\n=\\{E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:E=\\mathcal G_{604}^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}(E)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ext}_{604}^{\\Delta}(\\Gamma)\n=\\{E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{604}:E=\\mathcal G_{604}^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}(E)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里“扩张”是明确定义的不动点集合类，不是直接命名。谨慎语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{604}^{\\Delta}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E\\in\\mathsf{Ext}_{604}^{\\Delta}(\\Gamma)\\ A\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{604}^{\\Delta}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall E\\in\\mathsf{Ext}_{604}^{\\Delta}(\\Gamma)\\ A\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统把缺省性形式化为三元规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,J,C)\">\\((P,J,C)\\)</span> 与基础一致性谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cons}_{604}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cons}_{604}\\)</span>。缺省规则只检查基础道义演算下的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg J\">\\(\\neg J\\)</span> 不可证，而不是引入优先级或败者关系；这区别于可废止道义逻辑。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-合规说明\">10. 合规说明</h1>\n<p>缺省规则不是语义条件，也不是自然语言许可。它是第 5 节定义的局部规则关系；证明对象第 6 节逐项列出了基础行与缺省行的允许理由。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{DDO}_{604}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\mathsf{Default}_{604},\\operatorname{FV}_{604},\\operatorname{BV}_{604},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{604},\\operatorname{Sub}_{604},\\equiv_{\\alpha,604},\\mathsf{Ax}_{0}^{604},\\mathsf{Rule}_{0}^{604},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{0}^{604},\\operatorname{last}_{0,604},\\vdash_{0,604},\\mathsf{Thm}_{0,604},\n\\Delta,\\operatorname{Cons}_{604},\\mathfrak R_{Def}^{604,\\Delta},\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604},\n\\operatorname{last}_{Def,604},\\vdash_{604}^{\\Delta},\\mathsf{Cert}_{Def}^{604},\\operatorname{Cn}_{604}^{\\Delta},\n\\mathsf{DMod}_{604},\\Vdash_{604},\\models_{0,604},\\operatorname{Cn}_{0,604},\\operatorname{App}_{604}^{\\Delta},\n\\mathcal G_{604}^{\\Gamma,\\Delta},\\mathsf{Ext}_{604}^{\\Delta},\\models_{604}^{\\Delta}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{DDO}_{604}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{604},\\mathsf{Default}_{604},\\operatorname{FV}_{604},\\operatorname{BV}_{604},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{604},\\operatorname{Sub}_{604},\\equiv_{\\alpha,604},\\mathsf{Ax}_{0}^{604},\\mathsf{Rule}_{0}^{604},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{0}^{604},\\operatorname{last}_{0,604},\\vdash_{0,604},\\mathsf{Thm}_{0,604},\n\\Delta,\\operatorname{Cons}_{604},\\mathfrak R_{Def}^{604,\\Delta},\\mathsf{Proof}_{Def}^{604},\n\\operatorname{last}_{Def,604},\\vdash_{604}^{\\Delta},\\mathsf{Cert}_{Def}^{604},\\operatorname{Cn}_{604}^{\\Delta},\n\\mathsf{DMod}_{604},\\Vdash_{604},\\models_{0,604},\\operatorname{Cn}_{0,604},\\operatorname{App}_{604}^{\\Delta},\n\\mathcal G_{604}^{\\Gamma,\\Delta},\\mathsf{Ext}_{604}^{\\Delta},\\models_{604}^{\\Delta}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含基础道义演算、缺省规则基、句法一致性侧条件、有限证明、串行 Kripke 道义语义和缺省扩张语义；不在本条目中断言优先语义或扩张存在唯一性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-基础道义演算","text":"4. 基础道义演算","level":1},{"id":"5.-缺省侧条件","text":"5. 缺省侧条件","level":1},{"id":"6.-缺省证明对象","text":"6. 缺省证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-缺省可证性","text":"7. 缺省可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-扩张语义","text":"8. 扩张语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-合规说明","text":"10. 合规说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{obl}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad OA=\\operatorname{obl}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\qquad A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),